  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Ag. Marina/Psili Kastro</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "This ancient settlement site, with remains of a fortified acropolis and lower town, is located just south of modern Ag. Marina in Thessaly (Greece). Modern scholars consider it a likely identification for ancient Patronis/Tronis/Troneia, which is mentioned in ancient sources.",
